<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Zealous Conviction</ansi> mutation

An unshakeable certainty settles into you, bone-deep — your words
strike like blows and cling where they land.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive (Zealot)
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Your heightened presence drives your conviction-channel attacks harder
  and makes them cling, and no jeer or dread can shake your resolve —
  you shrug off blows aimed at your conviction

